AUTO_APPROVE	CH.XIV.F.001	The answer correctly describes VRS as descent into own downwash with recirculating vortex and loss of effective lift; while the verifier's suggested correction adds useful detail about the vertical/near-vertical descent trigger, the original answer is factually sound and covers the essential aerodynamic condition for a basic-level question.
