ESCALATE	HI.XII.C.R2.002	The verifier's critique directly contradicts the stated answer on a fundamental aerodynamic principle: whether rotor RPM increases or decreases during a banked autorotation turn without collective adjustment. This is safety-critical and requires authoritative source verification before shipping.
