AI_EDIT	HI.XVIII.G.S2.008	In IMC, the pilot has no visual horizon or ground references to gauge bank angle, rate of turn, or proximity to terrain — everything must be derived from instruments. The most critical difference is that spatial disorientation risk is extreme during turning autorotation in IMC because the vestibular system provides false cues. The pilot must trust instruments completely and avoid fixation. Priority order: (1) Attitude indicator — establish and maintain a shallow bank angle (no more than 15–20 degrees recommended to limit RPM decay and control workload); (2) Tachometer — continuous RPM monitoring, as it is non-negotiable for survival; (3) Altimeter — remaining altitude dictates urgency; (4) Heading indicator — track turn progress and roll-out heading; (5) VSI — confirm descent rate is manageable. Turns must be deliberate and shallow — this is not the time for aggressive bank angles. The pilot should announce the emergency on ATC frequency immediately if possible, as this is an extreme emergency situation with very limited recovery options.	->	In IMC, the pilot has no visual horizon or ground references to gauge bank angle, rate of turn, or proximity to terrain — everything must be derived from instruments. The most critical difference is that spatial disorientation risk is extreme during turning autorotation in IMC because the vestibular system provides false cues. The pilot must trust instruments completely and avoid fixation. Priority order: (1) Attitude indicator — establish and maintain a shallow bank angle (verify your aircraft's AFM for autorotation bank angle limits; commonly 15–20 degrees recommended to limit RPM decay and control workload); (2) Tachometer — continuous RPM monitoring, as it is non-negotiable for survival; (3) Altimeter — remaining altitude dictates urgency; (4) Heading indicator — track turn progress and roll-out heading; (5) VSI — confirm descent rate is manageable. Turns must be deliberate and conservative — this is not the time for aggressive bank angles. The pilot should announce the emergency on ATC frequency immediately if possible, as this is an extreme emergency situation with very limited recovery options.
